  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nFind the value of 4 - (5)/({1 + frac{1){{3 + (1)/({2 + frac{1){4}}}}}}}\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nExpression simplification\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n4 - (5)/({1 + frac{1){{3 + (1)/({2 + frac{1){4}}}}}}}\n\n⇒ 4 - (5)/(1 + frac{1){3 + (4)/(9)}}\n\n⇒ 4 - (5)/(1 + frac{9){31}}\n\n⇒ 4 - (5 times 31)/(40)\n\n⇒ (160 - 155)/(40)\n\n⇒ 5/40\n\n⇒ (1)/(8)\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (1).**",
